theory:
AMALIY MASHG'ULOT№19

Mavzu: Tasvirlar sifatini oshirish va audio signallarni ajratib olish usullarini tahlil qilish

Ishning maqsadi: MATLAB dasturida tasvir sifatini yaxshilash va audio signal tarkibidan kerakli chastota komponentlarini ajratib olish usullarini o'rganish.

1-topshiriq. Tasvir sifatini oshirish va shovqinni kamaytirish

Ishning bajarilish tartibi

MATLAB dasturiga tasvirni yuklang:

clc;

clear;

close all;

I = imread('image.jpg');

figure;

imshow(I);

title('Boshlang'ich tasvir');

Rangli tasvirni kulrang tasvirga o'tkazing:

I_gray = rgb2gray(I);

Tasvirga shovqin qo'shing:

I_noise = imnoise(I_gray, 'salt & pepper', 0.05);

Median filtr yordamida shovqinni kamaytiring:

I_filtered = medfilt2(I_noise, [3 3]);

Natijalarni birgalikda ko'rsating:

figure;

subplot(1,3,1);

imshow(I_gray);

title('Boshlang'ich tasvir');

subplot(1,3,2);

imshow(I_noise);

title('Shovqinli tasvir');

subplot(1,3,3);

imshow(I_filtered);

title('Filtrlangan tasvir');

Talaba bajarishi kerak:

Istalgan tasvirni MATLAB dasturiga yuklash.

Tasvirni kulrang ko'rinishga o'tkazish.

Tasvirga shovqin qo'shish.

Median filtrdan foydalanib shovqinni kamaytirish.

Uchta tasvirni taqqoslash.

Qaysi tasvir sifat jihatidan yaxshiroq ekanligini aniqlash.

2-topshiriq. Audio signalni ajratib olish va tahlil qilish

Ishning bajarilish tartibi

Audio faylni MATLAB dasturiga yuklang:

clc;

clear;

close all;

[x, Fs] = audioread('audio.wav');

Audio signalning vaqt o'qidagi ko'rinishini hosil qiling:

t = (0:length(x)-1)/Fs;

figure;

plot(t, x);

xlabel('Vaqt, s');

ylabel('Amplituda');

title('Boshlang'ich audio signal');

grid on;

Audio signalni chastota sohasida tahlil qiling:

N = length(x);

X = fft(x);

f = (0:N-1)*(Fs/N);

figure;

plot(f, abs(X));

xlabel('Chastota, Hz');

ylabel('Amplituda');

title('Audio signal spektri');

xlim([0 Fs/2]);

grid on;

Endi kerakli chastota diapazonini ajratib olish uchun past chastotali filtrdan foydalanamiz:

fc = 3000;

[b, a] = butter(6, fc/(Fs/2), 'low');

x_filtered = filter(b, a, x);

Filtrlangan signalni ko'rsating:

figure;

subplot(2,1,1);

plot(t, x);

title('Boshlang'ich audio signal');

xlabel('Vaqt, s');

ylabel('Amplituda');

grid on;

subplot(2,1,2);

plot(t, x_filtered);

title('Filtrlangan audio signal');

xlabel('Vaqt, s');

ylabel('Amplituda');

grid on;

Filtrlangan audio signalni eshiting:

sound(x_filtered, Fs);

Talaba bajarishi kerak:

Audio faylni MATLAB dasturiga yuklash.

Audio signalning vaqt bo'yicha grafigini qurish.

FFT yordamida signal spektrini olish.

Signal tarkibidagi asosiy chastotalarni aniqlash.

Past chastotali filtr yordamida kerakli signal qismini ajratish.

Boshlang'ich va filtrlangan audio signallarni taqqoslash.

